# MeoLaunch Agent Rules

- Follow `doc/07-agent-playbook.md`: one task card at a time; update Status when done.
- C symbols: `ml_` prefix. ObjC types: `ML` prefix. Core C must not import ObjC types.
- No CocoaPods, SPM, or third-party libraries for MVP.
- Primary build is `./Scripts/build.sh` (clang app bundle). Do not require full Xcode for M0–M4 acceptance.
- Do not edit product docs `doc/00`–`doc/06` unless the user asks. Sync API changes into `doc/04` and `doc/07` when C headers change.
- Default grid is 7×5; config path and schema live in `doc/06-config-schema.md`.
- Keep overlays lean: no WebView, no SwiftUI, custom `NSView` grid.
- Taskbar peek / minimize-all / multi-screen: follow `.cursor/rules/taskbar-peek-invariants.mdc` — do not regress those invariants.
